# Build context exclusions for `docker build` from the repository
# root. PR13 ships only the engine Dockerfile (core/engine/Dockerfile);
# per-adapter Dockerfiles arrive in PR14 and may grow this file.

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Editors / agent state
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Rust build artifacts
**/target/

# Go build output (named bin/ directories at component roots only —
# **/bin/ would also exclude core/engine/src/bin/ which holds the
# spectre CLI source).
core/control-plane/bin/
adapters/curl-impersonate/bin/
*.exe
*.test

# Node / pnpm
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.pnpm-store/

# Python virtualenvs and caches
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Generated protocol bindings (Rust regenerates from proto/ inside the
# image; the host-side gen/ tree must not pollute the build context).
proto/gen/
adapters/playwright/src/proto/

# Documentation, examples, and docs-only changes do not affect the
# engine binary. Excluding them keeps the build context small.
docs/
examples/
**/README.md
# Exception (PR17): the SeleniumBase adapter's pyproject.toml has
# `readme = "README.md"`, so hatchling reads it during the editable
# install that runs inside the operator image's seleniumbase-builder
# stage. The engine image does not consume this path.
!adapters/seleniumbase/README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
GOVERNANCE.md
SECURITY.md
NOTICE
VERSION

# Devcontainer assets (not needed in the engine image build).
.devcontainer/

# CI config
.github/

# Docker artifacts themselves
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
